{"id":"f3816129af6366c4","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-ideal-analytic-ideal.md","title":"ZFC Ideal Analytic Ideal","display":"df-zfc-ideal-analytic-ideal — ZFC Ideal Analytic Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ideal-analytic-ideal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ideal-analytic-ideal","58-df-zfc-ideal7-analytic-ideal"],"display":"df-zfc-ideal-analytic-ideal — ZFC Ideal Analytic Ideal","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-analytic-set.md]]","[[58-df-bijective.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ideal-analytic-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ideal-analytic-ideal</span><span>58-df-zfc-ideal7-analytic-ideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ideal-analytic-ideal — ZFC Ideal Analytic Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"266bdc015ee47b22\" href=\"?note=266bdc015ee47b22\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-analytic-set.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-analytic-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"58-df-bijective.md\">58-df-bijective.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal I\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal I\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ideal}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{Ideal}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (ideal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AnalyticSet}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{AnalyticSet}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (analytic subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"266bdc015ee47b22\" href=\"?note=266bdc015ee47b22\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-analytic-set.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-analytic-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (bijection predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"58-df-bijective.md\">58-df-bijective.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcIdealAnalyticIdeal}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcIdealAnalyticIdeal}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcIdealAnalyticIdeal}_S(\\mathcal I,X)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\n\\exists e\\in V\\;\\exists A\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Bijective}(e,\\omega,X)\n\\land\\mathrm{AnalyticSet}_S(A)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathcal I=\\left\\{B\\subseteq X:\\exists c\\in A\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(c(n)=1\\leftrightarrow e(n)\\in B\\bigr)\\right\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcIdealAnalyticIdeal}_S(\\mathcal I,X)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\n\\exists e\\in V\\;\\exists A\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Bijective}(e,\\omega,X)\n\\land\\mathrm{AnalyticSet}_S(A)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathcal I=\\left\\{B\\subseteq X:\\exists c\\in A\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(c(n)=1\\leftrightarrow e(n)\\in B\\bigr)\\right\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The second argument of the upstream ideal predicate is the family of allowable subsets, hence it must be <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> rather than the point set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> itself.</li>\n<li>The characteristic-code condition is expanded pointwise, so the definition does not rely on an undeclared operator <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_{B,e}\">\\(\\chi_{B,e}\\)</span> or an untyped arrow notation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-analytic-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"266bdc015ee47b22","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-analytic-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bijective.md","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-bijective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ideal}\\subseteq V^2$ (ideal predicate, see [[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-analytic-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"266bdc015ee47b22","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AnalyticSet}_S\\subseteq V$ (analytic subset of $\\omega^\\omega$, see [[../batch08/58-df-zfc-analytic-set.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bijective.md","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Bijective}\\subseteq V^3$ (bijection predicate, see [[58-df-bijective.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal I\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ideal}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AnalyticSet}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bijective}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcIdealAnalyticIdeal}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcIdealAnalyticIdeal}_S(\\mathcal I,X)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\operatorname{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\n\\exists e\\in V\\;\\exists A\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Bijective}(e,\\omega,X)\n\\land\\mathrm{AnalyticSet}_S(A)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathcal I=\\left\\{B\\subseteq X:\\exists c\\in A\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(c(n)=1\\leftrightarrow e(n)\\in B\\bigr)\\right\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_{B,e}","display":false}],"bytes":1673,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2269","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-ideal-analytic-ideal.md|58-df-zfc-ideal-analytic-ideal]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","6e4f95381faac4f9","266bdc015ee47b22","d583890235faf0d5"]}